This product is an independent implementation of the Graph Compact Format
(GCF) specification created by Dayna Blackwell / Blackwell Systems
(https://github.com/blackwell-systems/gcf). It is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Blackwell Systems. "GCF" and "Graph Compact Format" refer to
that specification.

Portions of this product are adapted from gcf-typescript
(https://github.com/blackwell-systems/gcf-typescript), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, and modified:
  * src/host.ts: the scalar quoting rules, canonical number and score
    formatting, and the streaming encoders;
  * src/wat/09_encoder.wat, src/wat/13_graph_enc.wat, src/wat/14_delta_enc.wat:
    the canonical encoding algorithms (layout selection, flattening,
    inline/shared schemas, constant columns, graph, session and delta
    encoding), reimplemented in WebAssembly text after their Zig version in
    gcf-zig (https://codeberg.org/felixdrp/gcf-zig).

